OL,3,AYou need #17,000 for a first home -
OL,4,Ahere's how to do it
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf buying your own home is the
OL,7,Ffinishing line, then saving up the
OL,8,Fmoney to get there is a marathon.
OL,10,FThe "Your First Home" scheme, announced
OL,11,Fon Saturday, aims to help first-time
OL,12,Fbuyers in England get on the housing
OL,13,Fladder with a small deposit.
OL,15,FCurrently a 5% deposit on the current
OL,16,Faverage UK house price of #272,000 plus
OL,17,Fmoving costs and legal fees - will set
OL,18,Fyou back about #16,850, according to
OL,19,Ffinancial information service
OL,20,FMoneyfacts.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
